  "title": "Tea with Mama",
  "abstract": "Tea Time with Mama is a documentary about Afnan and her mother as they recollect their\nmemories of their homeland in Yemen before they moved to Qatar. They also talk about the\nsacrifices and role of a mother while they spend tea time together. The motivation and rationale for this project are to illustrate the concept of home is not where you are but rather who are with. As Afnan and her mother recollect their memories in Yemen, they found comfort with each other while they make tea together.  Afnan Tag is also a proud wildcat in Northwestern University in Qatar and we found it heartwarming when she told us the story of her family. It only made us realized how everyone has a story to tell.",
